        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Tobin Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market these superb, really spacious, circa 207m2 , four-bedroom, four-bathroom terraced properties. Excellent location in the heart of Carrickmacross, across from the Civic Offices with Aldi and Lidl and all town amenities close by. Low maintenance exterior with quality fixture and fittings with the benefit of an ensuite bedroom on the ground floor, providing low running costs. Showhouse available to view by appointment. Properties eligible for the help to buy shceme and home purchase scheme. \r\n\r\nFeatures Include:  N.G.C.H., alarm, u.P.V.C. double glazed windows & doors, low maintenance, shaker style fitted kitchen, fitted utility with sink, ground floor store room, pine doors, quality sanityware, tarmac off street parking, floor area 207m², BER B.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises: Entrance Hallway Ground Floor:7.7m x 2.1m, Entrance Hallway Ardee Road, Front:3.2m x 2m, Sitting room:4.7m x 4.3m, Kitchen / Dining room:4.6m x 3.4m,2nd Floor Landing: 3.3m x 2.1m,Guest w.c.:2m x 1.5m,Utility Ground Floor:5.2m x 2m, Master bedroom:4 m x 3.5m, En-suite:2.1m x 1m,Bedroom 4 Ground Floor: 4.6m x 3.4m, En-suite:2m x 1.1m, Store Room Ground Floor:4.3m x 1.8m."
